notes               = "Untitled in source. English block is a raw machine draft (kept in the machine section); finished translation pending. **Page number corrected from 13 to 43–44** (July 2026, from a photograph): the '13' came from a mis-OCR'd page marker in raw-jafari-adobe-1.txt, where ۱۳ and 13 bracket this poem — almost certainly ۴۳ with the ۴ lost. The photograph shows folio ۴۳ and the poem running onto ۴۴. This also removes one of the book's two chronological inversions: a ۱۳۴۷ poem on page 13 sat among ۱۳۳۷–۱۳۴۱ material, and on 43–44 it sits exactly where it belongs. The Persian has been re-transcribed from the print, which restores the ezāfe diacritics, the line breaks the dump merged, the و... opening the دروغی line, and — a real semantic aid — the fatha on مانَد, 'resembles', where the dump's bare ماند could be read as 'remained'."
